# PROJECT NAME: RIZOO JOB
## Complete Professional International Job Vacancy Application

Build a complete, professional, modern, production-ready job vacancy mobile application named **RIZOO JOB** for Android, with a scalable backend and a secure web-based Admin Panel.

The application will publish job vacancies for India, Gulf countries, and Europe. The primary purpose is to help job seekers discover overseas employment opportunities, view vacancy details with photos, and apply directly through the app.

The application must have a premium user interface, smooth navigation, fast performance, real database integration, secure authentication, working application forms, image uploads, push notifications, and a fully functional administrator dashboard.

Do not build only a static UI or demo. Implement real functionality wherever supported by the chosen platform.

